  "clause_1_scope": "1.1 This standard prescribes the performance requirements of sports footwear used for general purposes (for example fitness, exercising, walking and light sports activities etc). 1.2 This standard does not cover the performance requirement for following: a) Performance sports footwear (jogging, running including trail running, adventure sport, trekking, climbing and etc); and b) Professional sports footwear.",
